## Reference Sheet

**STM32F411 memory map (simplified)**

| Region | Base address |
|---|---|
| Flash | `0x0800 0000` |
| SRAM | `0x2000 0000` |
| Peripherals | `0x4000 0000` |
| GPIOA | `0x4002 0000` |
| RCC | `0x4002 3800` |

**GPIOA registers:** `MODER` offset `0x00`, `ODR` offset `0x14`, `BSRR` offset `0x18`.

**BSRR:** writing `1` to bit *n* (0–15) **sets** pin *n*. Writing `1` to bit *n*+16 **resets** pin *n*.

**Thumb encodings (16-bit)**

| Instruction | Encoding |
|---|---|
| `MOVS Rd, #imm8` | `0x2000 \| (Rd << 8) \| imm8` |
| `STR Rt, [Rn]` | `0x6000 \| (Rn << 3) \| Rt` |
| `B .` (branch to self) | `0xE7FE` |

**Useful formulae**

- Battery life (hours) = capacity (mAh) ÷ average current (mA)
- 1 year = 8,760 hours







